gpui-pre-macos 0.3.10
Upstream: https://github.com/zed-industries/zed (gpui-pre snapshot by https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit)
License: Apache-2.0; the upstream LICENSE-APACHE is distributed with gpui-pre-macos.

Newport modifies gpui-pre-macos for key events that keep the physical key and
the layout's metadata for terminal input, and presenting a window's last frame
when it is shown again. The changed files are src/events.rs and src/window.rs.
All other published package files remain unchanged.
